# ABTalks OAuth 2.0 Credentials
#
# 1. GitHub OAuth:
#    - Register a new OAuth App at https://github.com/settings/developers
#    - Set Authorization callback URL to: http://localhost:5173/auth/callback (or your production URL)
#    - Copy your Client ID below:
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=

# 2. Google OAuth 2.0:
#    - Create an OAuth 2.0 Web Client in Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#    - Add Authorized redirect URIs: http://localhost:5173/auth/callback (or your production URL)
#    - Copy your Web Client ID below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

